nsure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401/field-3/e85b104550594fbd1615a4f48a304698ba83de3b3a248fedb98eead123f98c7d" :answer/id #uuid "fc37a4d1-41f5-5082-a7d0-47c8f1b4c0d0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "y(t)={e}^{-At}x(t)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401/field-3" :answer-field/id #uuid "71358d00-1a79-5690-afde-09856323703e" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-335401/field-3/1a4a214288e4f78dfaad78bada5741811ec216944f96c98cc10f242fa32b2445" :answer-field/choices ["q-335401/field-3/077038889b1055155d58f45e5f684a956a0ed943481555f4be7a5b370030c74c" "q-335401/field-3/223f5b752a5c2ea2024724a577254201ae8d54b81472f9845258f38e6bf82ade" "q-335401/field-3/1a4a214288e4f78dfaad78bada5741811ec216944f96c98cc10f242fa32b2445" "q-335401/field-3/e85b104550594fbd1615a4f48a304698ba83de3b3a248fedb98eead123f98c7d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401/field-4/0d652a7f8f9c1a42526cff8daf2a3a3ea56f579cc8a9cef8a5cb8d5922125a76" :answer/id #uuid "0de29c8b-ee9d-5444-84bc-450cd2ad94e5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "evaluating at $t=0$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401/field-4/a6c55c12aa3803225444a804ec014a2cfebdf852f944e3537912513ca394c9ec" :answer/id #uuid "f0d54ff3-1421-5515-bc96-02b3a94f25a8" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "substituting ${e}^{At}y(t)=x(t)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401/field-4/f749d373f36b73b0de831ea8ea8419ce510169b7fc94f0c58ed2ac4aa2800881" :answer/id #uuid "be3909e7-b394-55d2-84ce-432f50b2c942" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "multiplying both sides by ${e}^{At}$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401/field-4/18a578c7b04a3b815ae5d4a457af4a650d712815d58e13e1ae858eb82215727e" :answer/id #uuid "4c989dda-c9f5-5f0f-8352-db277961a782" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "applying a change of variables" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401/field-4" :answer-field/id #uuid "e6260925-0fbe-56cf-99b0-f8afd10b16e4" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-335401/field-4/a6c55c12aa3803225444a804ec014a2cfebdf852f944e3537912513ca394c9ec" :answer-field/choices ["q-335401/field-4/0d652a7f8f9c1a42526cff8daf2a3a3ea56f579cc8a9cef8a5cb8d5922125a76" "q-335401/field-4/a6c55c12aa3803225444a804ec014a2cfebdf852f944e3537912513ca394c9ec" "q-335401/field-4/f749d373f36b73b0de831ea8ea8419ce510169b7fc94f0c58ed2ac4aa2800881" "q-335401/field-4/18a578c7b04a3b815ae5d4a457af4a650d712815d58e13e1ae858eb82215727e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-335401" :question/id #uuid "b0202c33-02b6-54b1-9971-6d025f9fe504" :question/math-academy-id "q-335401" :question/problem "Consider the inhomogeneous system  ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix. A derivation of the formula for the solution $x(t)$ passing through $x(0)$ is presented below.\n\n$\\text{L1}:\\,$ Let $y(t)={e}^{-At}x(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L2}:\\,$ ${y}^{′}(t)=-A{e}^{-At}x(t)+{e}^{-At}{x}^{′}(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L3}:\\,$ ${y}^{′}(t)={e}^{-At}g(t)$  \n\n$\\text{L4}:\\,$ $y(t)-y(0)={\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\n$\\text{L5}:\\,$ $y(0)=x(0)$ \n\n$\\text{L6}:\\,$ $y(t)=x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$  \n\n$\\text{L7}:\\,$ ${e}^{At}y(t)={e}^{At}x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\n$\\text{L8}:\\,$ ${e}^{At}y(t)=x(t)$\n\n$\\text{L9}:\\,$ $x(t)={e}^{At}x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s$\n\nSelect the correct options to justify each step of the reasoning.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L3}$ follows from $\\text{L2}$ by  \n{{field-1}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L6}$ follows from line\n{{field-2}}\nby substituting \n{{field-3}}.\n\n$\\,$ Line $\\text{L9}$ follows from line $\\text{L7}$ by  \n{{field-4}}." :question/worked-solution "Let's justify each of the selected steps.\n\n- We first consider lines $\\text{L2}$ and $\\text{L3}.$ Starting from\n\n$$\n{y}^{′}(t)=-A{e}^{-At}x(t)+{e}^{-At}{x}^{′}(t)\n$$\n\nin $\\text{L2}$ and substituting ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t)$ from the original system gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′}(t) & =-A{e}^{-At}x(t)+{e}^{-At}(Ax(t)+g(t)) \\\\  & =-A{e}^{-At}x(t)+A{e}^{-At}x(t)+{e}^{-At}g(t) \\\\  & ={e}^{-At}g(t).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L3}$ follows from $\\text{L2}$ by $\\text{substituting }{x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t).$\n\n- Next, we consider lines $\\text{L4}$ and $\\text{L6}.$ From $\\text{L4}$ we have\n\n$$\ny(t)-y(0)={\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nUsing $y(0)=x(0)$ from $\\text{L5}$, this becomes\n\n$$\ny(t)-x(0)={\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s,\n$$\n\nso\n\n$$\ny(t)=x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{-As}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nThus, $\\text{L6}$ follows from $\\text{L4}$ by substituting $y(0)=x(0).$\n\n- Finally, we consider lines $\\text{L7}$ and $\\text{L9}.$ From $\\text{L8}$ we know that\n\n$$\n{e}^{At}y(t)=x(t).\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${e}^{At}y(t)=x(t)$ into\n\n$$\n{e}^{At}y(t)={e}^{At}x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s\n$$\n\nfrom $\\text{L7}$ gives\n\n$$\nx(t)={e}^{At}x(0)+{\\int }_{0}^{t}{e}^{A(t-s)}g(s)\\,\\text{d}s.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $\\text{L9}$ follows from $\\text{L7}$ by $\\text{substituting }{e}^{At}y(t)=x(t).$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-335401/field-1" "q-335401/field-2" "q-335401/field-3" "q-335401/field-4"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4c4b78fa-76af-5261-87a0-d1960aa0fe04"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-335401"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-335404/field-1/3553cedeff4c8d1807c2e5ee6d248ad1263c81ed92e6cc6e85bc709e30fdfbdf" :answer/id #uuid "dd348802-835c-5b2c-be9f-a78a25d21921" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "substituting ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t)+g(t)$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-335404/field-1/18a578c7b04a3b815ae5d4a457af4a650d712815d58e13e1ae858eb82215727e" :answer/id #uuid "7b16d372-f805-566b-9866-4ee4a